---
// Nav — "The Instrument Capsule" (docs/design-research/specs-v2/nav.md, v2).
// One machined glass capsule floating above the void; the logo is a single
// vectorized SVG lockup (week-grid mark fused with the Sentient 400
// wordmark), not an icon beside plain text. Per synthesis (c) Nav #1: the
// logo's one-shot rim-flash is CUT — the logo renders fully static.
//
// The wordmark `d` attribute below is pre-vectorized (opentype.js, Sentient
// Regular, "Taskflow" @ 24px em, tracking -0.01em) per the spec's own
// generation recipe. Stored as one unbroken string per Risk #3 — never
// hand-edit or reflow it.
